{"4437710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Home Invader", "steam_appid": 4437710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence is survival in <strong>Home Invader</strong>, a first-person psychological thriller that blends stealth, tension, and puzzle-solving into a grounded yet unsettling experience. As Rushad, a contract infiltrator hired for a dangerous assignment, you must enter a private estate, uncover sensitive information, and escape without being detected. Every step matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/cf8a5a52e2f9d15276d4bc7fe1af1805.poster.avif?t=1774871055\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/cf8a5a52e2f9d15276d4bc7fe1af1805.webm?t=1774871055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/cf8a5a52e2f9d15276d4bc7fe1af1805.mp4?t=1774871055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;In a place where you do not belong, every sound you make could be your last&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an imagined sector of New OP Town (New Delhi) and Streets of Rohtak, <strong>Home Invader</strong> places players inside a sprawling private villa tied to a powerful figure and their hidden secrets. Acting under the guidance of a mysterious operator, Rushad is tasked with infiltrating the property to retrieve confidential documents and valuables that could expose the truth behind its owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/f57be3a97b7a6534721f7e84f64f3d64.poster.avif?t=1774871055\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/f57be3a97b7a6534721f7e84f64f3d64.webm?t=1774871055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/f57be3a97b7a6534721f7e84f64f3d64.mp4?t=1774871055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple home invasion turned out to be far more than a calculated contract. What was supposed to be a simple entry and quiet extraction quickly shifts into something heavier, where tiny details start to feel wrong and the house starts to feel eerie. The deeper you go, the more it becomes clear that you may have bitten off on  more than what you could chew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/c16467dbe2d05624d3cebdc5f909ab1d.poster.avif?t=1774871055\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/c16467dbe2d05624d3cebdc5f909ab1d.webm?t=1774871055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/c16467dbe2d05624d3cebdc5f909ab1d.mp4?t=1774871055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-Driven Gameplay:</strong><br>A core Noise Meter system tracks every movement you make. Walk carefully, avoid destructible objects, and plan each action with precision to remain undetected.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Psychological Setting:</strong><br>A dark, realistic environment paired with immersive sound design builds sustained tension throughout the experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Puzzle Solving:</strong><br>Unlock restricted areas, discover hidden rooms, solve environmental puzzles, and access secure systems through observation and logic.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Objective Progression:</strong><br>Choose your own approach. Complete objectives in the order you prefer and explore the villa freely, balancing risk, time, and reward based on your judgement.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warning:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home Invader</strong> contains mature themes, references to criminal activity, morally complex characters, disturbing situations, and strong language. The game includes tense scenarios and emotionally sensitive environments that may be unsettling to some players. All characters, locations, and events depicted are fictional and are not intended to represent real individuals, communities, or institutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence is survival in <strong>Home Invader</strong>, a first-person psychological thriller that blends stealth, tension, and puzzle-solving into a grounded yet unsettling experience. As Rushad, a contract infiltrator hired for a dangerous assignment, you must enter a private estate, uncover sensitive information, and escape without being detected. Every step matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse