ckly shifts into something heavier, where tiny details start to feel wrong and the house starts to feel eerie. The deeper you go, the more it becomes clear that you may have bitten off on  more than what you could chew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/c16467dbe2d05624d3cebdc5f909ab1d.poster.avif?t=1774871055\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/c16467dbe2d05624d3cebdc5f909ab1d.webm?t=1774871055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4437710/extras/c16467dbe2d05624d3cebdc5f909ab1d.mp4?t=1774871055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-Driven Gameplay:</strong><br>A core Noise Meter system tracks every movement you make. Walk carefully, avoid destructible objects, and plan each action with precision to remain undetected.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Psychological Setting:</strong><br>A dark, realistic environment paired with immersive sound design builds sustained tension throughout the experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Puzzle Solving:</strong><br>Unlock restricted areas, discover hidden rooms, solve environmental puzzles, and access secure systems through observation and logic.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Objective Progression:</strong><br>Choose your own approach. Complete objectives in the order you prefer and explore the villa freely, balancing risk, time, and reward based on your judgement.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\